		{
			"id":"5a1191bb2fb6dad3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rewards\n\n- A pathway to the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]]\n- The possibility of picking coins that were thrown into the [[Well.canvas|Well]] before it was drained. (Coins disappear if picked)",
